#: rainey_record/1
msgctxt "Tag Nom d'objet (MAJUSCULES)"
msgid "RECORD PLAYER"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_chat/0/9/b/1
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Oh... hi!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_chat/0/10/b/1
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Surprised you came back."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_chat/0/13/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hi Rainey. Tony wants to talk to you."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_chat/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Is this about his vocal range again? I've told him before his soprano's nothing to be ashamed of."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_chat/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "It doesn't mean that there's anything wrong with his toolbox."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_chat/0/g-0/6
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "HI TONY! We weren't talkin' about your pecker or nothin'."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_chat/0/g-0/14
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Yeah ...I'm just gonna ignore that."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_chat/0/g-0/22
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "If it isn't my favorite gal! How ya doin' dollface?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_chat/0/g-0/30
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Better since the last time I saw you."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_chat/0/g-0/38
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Don't I know it. I thought the neighbors were gonna come knocking."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_chat/0/g-0/46/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Do you two need a room?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_chat/0/g-0/47/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you guys...?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_chat/0/g-0/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What's going on here?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_chat/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Oh, stop. Tony was just makin' sure my screws were all firmly in place."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_chat/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "And boy were they!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_chat/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Now they can hear me down the block if I really put my mind to it."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_chat/0/g-1/24
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "And I owe Tony for that. Without his screwdriver, I'd have been stuck the way I was."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_chat/0/g-1/32
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "I'm real glad you feel that way Rain', cause I need a favor."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_chat/0/g-1/40
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "I been teachin' our mutual friend here the ways 'a love n' courtship."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_chat/0/g-1/51
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "We got a little disagreement about how to put your best foot forward when it comes to the romance."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_chat/0/g-1/59
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Oh boy... don't tell me..."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_chat/0/g-1/67
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "You did the whole 'paint over the mold' and ignore your crush speech, didn't you."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_chat/0/g-1/75
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Huh? How'd you know? I ain't never gave you my workshop before."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_chat/0/g-1/83
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Call it a hunch."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_chat/0/g-1/91
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Or the fact that I've heard you talk about it way too many times."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_chat/0/g-1/99
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "So what do you need from me?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_chat/0/g-1/107
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Just tell us which one of us is right."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_chat/0/g-1/115
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "I've been told that I shouldn't ignore my crush and pretend to be someone I'm not."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_chat/0/g-1/123
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Yeah, don't do that."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_chat/0/g-1/134
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "You're sayin'... I'm wrong!? But I'm the maestro of the workshop!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_chat/0/g-1/142/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I hate to say I told you so, but..."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_chat/0/g-1/143/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How embarrassing for you."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_chat/0/g-1/144/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You might be wrong but you're still hot."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_chat/0/g-1/c-4/13
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Do ya hate it? Because it sounds like you're kinda enjoyin' it..."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_chat/0/g-1/c-4/21/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I always enjoy talking to you. Even when you're wrong."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_chat/0/g-1/c-4/21/c-0/15
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "I got too much work to do to keep goin' on about this."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_chat/0/g-1/c-4/21/c-0/23
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "See ya around."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_chat/0/g-1/c-5/13
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "I ain't never been embarrassed a day in my life!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_chat/0/g-1/c-5/21
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "But I don't need to stand here and take this!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_chat/0/g-1/c-5/29
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "I got work to do!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_chat/0/g-1/c-6/13
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Yeah? I ain't wrong, but at least you can see what's right in front of ya."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_chat/0/g-1/c-6/21
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "I got a lotta work to get back to, so I'll be seein' ya."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_chat/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Tony is so good at fixing everyone's problems but his own."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_chat/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Take it easy on him, would you? He is a good egg."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_chat/0/g-2/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I will."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_chat/0/g-2/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm just gonna go now..."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_chat/0/g-2/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "He really does seem sweet."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_chat/0/g-2/c-7/7
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Good. You take care too, alright?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_chat/0/g-2/c-8/7
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Sure. Later, sugar."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_chat/0/g-2/c-9/7
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "It's because he is! He talks big, but what you see is what you get with Tony."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_chat/0/g-2/c-9/15
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Take care of him and yourself, alright?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_first_encounter/0/6
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The beautiful flapper you see before you stands in stark contrast to the strange music that plays when you turn on your record player."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_first_encounter/0/14
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Where she seems sweet with an old-world sort of beauty, the music she plays is all kinds of wrong — it skips and goes from too fast, to too slow."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_first_encounter/0/22
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She dances to it all the same, swinging her arms and legs in time to the herky-jerky rhythm of some ancient record."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_first_encounter/0/33
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Don't just stand there like a wet blanket!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_first_encounter/0/41
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "You get a wiggle on. Let's see you dance!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_first_encounter/0/49/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm not much of a dancer"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_first_encounter/0/50/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't think the music is supposed to sound like that"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_first_encounter/0/51/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "May I have this dance?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_first_encounter/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "You don't have to be, just move!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_first_encounter/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "What? Sure it does!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_first_encounter/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Now shake it!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_first_encounter/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Pipe down and just dance already!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_first_encounter/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You give it your best shot, which seems to please her."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_first_encounter/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Now you're on the trolley!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_first_encounter/0/g-0/22/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_first_encounter/0/g-0/23/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You mean... I got it?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_first_encounter/0/g-0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Trolley?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_first_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Can't be any clearer than that! You're on the trolley!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_first_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/15
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "I'm sayin'..."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_first_encounter/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Exactly what I said!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_first_encounter/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "It's a saying! I'm sayin'..."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_first_encounter/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "You're gettin' it!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_first_encounter/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Mercifully she turns the music off."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_first_encounter/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Well, well, well. It's about time you came to see me."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_first_encounter/0/g-1/24
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "My name's Rainey."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_first_encounter/0/g-1/38
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "I've been waitin' for you to come over and see me sometime."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_first_encounter/0/g-1/46
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "You've been all over this house but you never come my way!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_first_encounter/0/g-1/54/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I didn't even know you still worked honestly."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_first_encounter/0/g-1/55/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I was gonna come around soon..."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_first_encounter/0/g-1/56/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm not really into vinyls."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_first_encounter/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Of course I still work!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_first_encounter/0/g-1/c-6/18
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "I might be an antique, but there's still plenty of life in this old record player!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_first_encounter/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Uh huh. Baloney!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_first_encounter/0/g-1/c-8/7
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Oh shoot, that's like saying you're not really into rainbows or, or jazz music."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_first_encounter/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Well, anyway, it is so great to see a new face around here, even if your face ain't exactly new to me."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_first_encounter/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Nobody ever seems to wanna hang out anymore. I can't imagine why!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_first_encounter/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "I used to be the belle of the ball. Everyone was so happy to see me at a party."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_first_encounter/0/g-2/24
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Now it's always just me and my records..."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_first_encounter/0/g-2/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's probably because you're playing them at the wrong speed."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_first_encounter/0/g-2/36/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "They're bored of you."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_first_encounter/0/g-2/37/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I can't imagine why..."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_first_encounter/0/g-2/c-9/7
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "The wrong speed? You spifflicated or somethin'?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_first_encounter/0/g-2/c-9/15
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "It's just fine!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_first_encounter/0/g-2/c-10/7
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "BUT WHY?!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_first_encounter/0/g-2/c-10/15
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "What'd I ever do but be a good time!?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_first_encounter/0/g-2/c-11/7
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Me neither..."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_first_encounter/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Well... whatever!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_first_encounter/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "I'm gonna keep the party goin' here."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_first_encounter/0/g-3/16
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Feel free to stick around... if you can keep up!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_first_encounter/0/g-3/24
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Otherwise, you can beat it. This beat's for expert hoofers only."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_first_encounter/0/g-3/32
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Rainey's frenetic, high-pitched record is too much for most anyone to keep up with—you decide to check in with her another time."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Rainey is in her own world once again, jamming out to a record so unpleasantly high-pitched and sped-up you're amazed no one has come by to complain."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/11
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Well well well! Look what the cat dragged in!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/19
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "You just couldn't get enough of my gay little tunes, huh?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is that what you call them?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh you better believe it."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/29/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I was just coming to ask you to turn it down."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Uh, yeah? Ain't nothin' else like it!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "I knew you couldn't stay away!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Oh yeah? Too bad for you, sugar!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "If that's all you wanted you can get lost! Go on! Screw!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "This house is full of wet blankets, man!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "I can't believe I'm here cuttin' a rug all by my lonesome!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Time was I'd be surrounded by sheiks and shebas all dolled up and ready to dance the night away!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "But I can't dwell on that... I can shimmy and shake just fine all by myself!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/g-0/32
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Rainey turns away from you, dancing to her own heart's content without a care in the world."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/g-0/40
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She ignores you entirely, jamming out to her unpleasantly sped-up music."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/g-0/51
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "And then, with no warning or fanfare, the music stops with an unpleasant scratch."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/g-0/68
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "<i>Enough.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/g-0/79/b/1
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The needle of Rainey’s record player is clutched in the hands of a powdered and perfectly coiffed dandy—he somehow manages to look both put out and flirtatious all at once. He leers at the two of you, an artificial smile plastered to his pale face."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/g-0/80/b/1
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The needle of Rainey’s record player is clutched in the hands of the perfectly coiffed and powdered Scandalabra. He somehow manages to look both put out and flirtatious all at once. He leers at the two of you, an artificial smile plastered to his pale face."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/g-0/83 rainey_record/jonwick_rainey/0/17
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Hey, what gives!?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/g-0/91
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "I am <i>trying</i> to work on my love poetry."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/g-0/99
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Normally it would be effortless for an artist of my caliber."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/g-0/107
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "But your disgusting chaos noise is filling the house and pushing all the meter out of my mind."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/g-0/118
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Either shut it off... or give me a little kiss..."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/g-0/126/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's awfully rude."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/g-0/127/s/0 rainey_record/jonwick_rainey/0/57/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It is a little loud, Rainey..."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/g-0/128/s/0 rainey_record/jonwick_rainey/0/58/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think something might actually be wrong with Rainey..."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "It is, isn't it? I can't believe you made me come all the way over here from the other end of the table practically!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/15
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Oh pipe down, ya powdered palooka."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/26 rainey_record/jonwick_rainey/0/49
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Mind your potatoes and get lost!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/g-0/c-4/7 rainey_record/jonwick_rainey/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Says you!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/g-0/c-4/15 rainey_record/jonwick_rainey/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Jazz should always be loud and hot!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Oh please, don't make excuses for her."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/g-0/c-5/15 rainey_record/jonwick_rainey/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Oh lay off! Goddamn killjoy."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/g-0/c-5/26 rainey_record/jonwick_rainey/0/c-1/18
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Nobody likes a gatecrasher, so beat it!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Do you even hear the nonsense she spouts?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "It is IMPOSSIBLE to speak to her."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Why, even in the best of times the music she played was unbearable... though of course it's become even worse since she took that tumble."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/g-1/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What tumble?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/g-1/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "She wasn't always like this?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Oh I wouldn't know... I would never tell..."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Not... quite as loud. Marginally more bearable."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "She simply hasn't been the same since that party..."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "If you want to know more about this scandal... I would ask Celia. She was there for it all, and most importantly..."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/g-2/19
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "She's at least given me a kiss!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/g-2/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "She's kissed you?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/g-2/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't believe you."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/g-2/29/s/0 rainey_record/jonwick_rainey/0/g-0/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Who is Celia?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/g-2/30/s/0 rainey_record/jonwick_rainey/0/g-0/22/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Actually... she gave me a note about that...!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/g-2/c-8/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Certainly! I was quite the charmer!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/g-2/c-8/15
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Am. Quite the charmer."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/g-2/c-9/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "It doesn't matter... I can still taste the stucco..."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/g-2/c-10/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Ohhh... a candle never tells!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/g-2/c-10/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Who is she?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/g-2/c-10/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh but you must... you must!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/g-2/c-10/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "<i>I mustn't... I mustn't!</i>"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/g-2/c-10/15/c-1/15
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "<i>She's the ceiling! Upstairs you must fly!</i>"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/g-2/c-11/7 rainey_record/second_encounter/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "I'm not wasting a minute more on this if no one here will kiss me or turn the volume down."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/g-3/11 rainey_record/jonwick_rainey/0/g-1/11
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Oh go climb up your thumb, mister!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/g-3/22 rainey_record/jonwick_rainey/0/g-1/22
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Don't you listen to a word he said."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/g-3/30 rainey_record/jonwick_rainey/0/g-1/30
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "I'm fine and I've always been fine!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/g-3/38 rainey_record/jonwick_rainey/0/g-1/38
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "I'm still hittin' on all eight!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/g-3/46 rainey_record/jonwick_rainey/0/g-1/46
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "But whatever. If that goofy guy is gonna come back here and bump his gums every time I start havin' a little fun..."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/g-3/54 rainey_record/jonwick_rainey/0/g-1/54
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "I'll just dance here all by my lonesome to the music in my head."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/g-3/62 rainey_record/jonwick_rainey/0/g-1/62
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "And dance she does, in complete silence. Sometimes she hums a little, but even her humming has the same strange speed and pitch to it."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/second_encounter/0/g-3/70 rainey_record/jonwick_rainey/0/g-1/70
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Perhaps speaking to Celia might help you clear all this up."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/jonwick_rainey/0/6
msgctxt "Jon Wick"
msgid "<i>Enough.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/jonwick_rainey/0/25
msgctxt "Jon Wick"
msgid "I know a lot about what's going on in this house..."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/jonwick_rainey/0/33
msgctxt "Jon Wick"
msgid "And sometimes I can only let something stand for so long before involving myself."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/jonwick_rainey/0/41
msgctxt "Jon Wick"
msgid "Rainey isn't telling you the full story."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/jonwick_rainey/0/59/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "And why should you just butt in on what's going on with her?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/jonwick_rainey/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Jon Wick"
msgid "...I try to help whenever I feel it's right."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/jonwick_rainey/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Jon Wick"
msgid "She hasn't been the same since that party..."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/jonwick_rainey/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Jon Wick"
msgid "Ask Celia about it. She was there for it all..."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/jonwick_rainey/0/g-0/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Okay, I'll do it."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/jonwick_rainey/0/g-0/21/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nah."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/jonwick_rainey/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Jon Wick"
msgid "The ceiling."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/jonwick_rainey/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Jon Wick"
msgid "Your loss."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/jonwick_rainey/0/g-0/c-6/7 rainey_record/jonwick_rainey/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Jon Wick"
msgid "I'll be on my way."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/celia_missionincomplete/0/0 rainey_record/celia_rudy/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Rainey is still dancing to music no one but she can hear..."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/celia_missionincomplete/0/8
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Are you here to join me?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/celia_missionincomplete/0/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "It occurs to you that you meant to speak to Celia about Rainey's condition."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/celia_missionincomplete/0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Got something I need to do first..."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/celia_missionincomplete/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Well beat it then!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/celia_rudy/0/8
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "You here to join me?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/celia_rudy/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I thought we might talk about your music..."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/celia_rudy/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Celia told me what happened to you all those years ago."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/celia_rudy/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Yeah? What about it?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/celia_rudy/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "...what do you mean?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/celia_rudy/0/cf_realize_rainey_skip/4
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You pull Celia's note out and begin to read from it."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/celia_rudy/0/cf_realize_rainey_skip/12/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "There was a party in the 70's... a really wild one."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/celia_rudy/0/cf_realize_rainey_skip/c-2/7
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Yeah, so? We had parties all the time around here!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/celia_rudy/0/cf_realize_rainey_skip/c-2/18/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It was a Roaring Twenties themed party... flappers and gangsters all around cutting a rug and all that."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/celia_rudy/0/cf_realize_rainey_skip/c-2/18/c-0/7
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Sounds about right, yeah... just like the good old days."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/celia_rudy/0/cf_realize_rainey_skip/c-2/18/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Somebody had a little too much to drink and hip-checked you. Hard."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/celia_rudy/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Well, that happens all the time at parties, so what?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/celia_rudy/0/g-0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You fell over and the music stopped for a little while..."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/celia_rudy/0/g-0/c-3/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "They picked you back up and tried to get you going again but the music just wasn't right."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/celia_rudy/0/g-0/c-3/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "That's enough."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/celia_rudy/0/g-0/c-3/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So they put you away for the rest of the party..."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/celia_rudy/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "I said THAT'S ENOUGH!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/celia_rudy/0/g-1/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You don't want to hear the rest?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/celia_rudy/0/g-1/12/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm sorry Rainey."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/celia_rudy/0/g-1/13/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why are you so upset by this?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/celia_rudy/0/g-1/c-4/7
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "...I remember it."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/celia_rudy/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Whatever."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/celia_rudy/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "I lived it. I don't need you to tell me."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/celia_rudy/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Yeah, it's all coming back to me now."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/celia_rudy/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "I got moved into the attic to rot."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/celia_rudy/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "And over the years, I started hearing music again but... it wasn't mine."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/celia_rudy/0/g-2/24
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "I heard from the others... they brought in a cassette player."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/celia_rudy/0/g-2/32
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Then later it was a CD player."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/celia_rudy/0/g-2/40
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Then... somethin' about... streaming?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/celia_rudy/0/g-2/48
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "I didn't want to know anymore."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/celia_rudy/0/g-2/56
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "But whatever. I don't care if Celia said all that."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/celia_rudy/0/g-2/64
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "So what if I fell over?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/celia_rudy/0/g-2/72
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "I'm still me!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/celia_rudy/0/g-2/83
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Everything is just fine!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/celia_rudy/0/g-2/91/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/celia_rudy/0/g-2/92/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is it?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/celia_rudy/0/g-2/93/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're right, there's nothing wrong with you."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/celia_rudy/0/g-2/c-7/7
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "I AM!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/celia_rudy/0/g-2/c-8/7
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "IT IS!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/celia_rudy/0/g-2/c-9/7
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "DAMN RIGHT THERE AIN'T!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/celia_rudy/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "If you all got such a big problem with me playin' my jazz records as loud as I want, you can go chase yourself!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/celia_rudy/0/g-3/11
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "I'm gonna play my tunes as loud as I want... AND!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/celia_rudy/0/g-3/19
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "I'm gonna dig out all the old classics too."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/celia_rudy/0/g-3/30
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Keyes ain't the only one who can do classical music."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/celia_rudy/0/g-3/41
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "You'll see... you'll all see!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/celia_rudy/0/g-3/49
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "I'm gonna go get those records RIGHT NOW!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/celia_rudy/0/g-3/60
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She leaves without a second look, humming to herself."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_checkup_whales/0/9
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Oh hi!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_checkup_whales/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What the hell is that noise?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_checkup_whales/0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hey, Rainey, I thought I'd come check on you..."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_checkup_whales/0/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is someone torturing a cartoon chipmunk in here?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_checkup_whales/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "What, you don't recognize it?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_checkup_whales/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Oh hey, you're just in time to listen with me."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_checkup_whales/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Jeepers creepers, no."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_checkup_whales/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Oh, this? It's your deep-sea mammal's record. Mm-hmm."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_checkup_whales/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Track 3: Song of the Sperm Whale."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_checkup_whales/0/g-0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I own that?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_checkup_whales/0/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Where the hell did that come from?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_checkup_whales/0/g-0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What in the world..."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_checkup_whales/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "According to the sticker on the sleeve... you donated money to Reiki for Whales."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_checkup_whales/0/g-1/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "This is why I never leave the house... I can't say no to charity."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_checkup_whales/0/g-1/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I really don't remember that."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_checkup_whales/0/g-1/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "A worthy cause."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_checkup_whales/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Oh you're real free with your dough ain'tcha."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_checkup_whales/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Yeah I bet you don't."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_checkup_whales/0/g-1/c-8/7
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "If you say so."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_checkup_whales/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Anyway you can go now. I'm really feelin' these whale sounds..."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_checkup_whales/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "And I don't want nobody here to kill my whale buzz!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_checkup_whales/0/g-2/19
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Go on now! Sneak!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/Rainey_Checkup3/0/9
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "It's a bit difficult to tell exactly what music Rainey is listening to at such a dreadful speed, but it sounds almost like a high-pitched orchestra..."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/Rainey_Checkup3/0/17
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "...if the orchestra was composed of awkward high school kids."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/Rainey_Checkup3/0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What the hell is this?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/Rainey_Checkup3/0/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What happened to the whale sounds?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/Rainey_Checkup3/0/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is this a high school band?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/Rainey_Checkup3/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Well, Record Sleeve says it's your local high school band."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/Rainey_Checkup3/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "None of these kiddos are virtuosos but..."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/Rainey_Checkup3/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Can't you just feel the human spirit radiating from all those shaky notes?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/Rainey_Checkup3/0/g-0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I can feel 'something' radiating..."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/Rainey_Checkup3/0/g-0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Get a grip, Rainey."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/Rainey_Checkup3/0/g-0/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah... this brings back great memories!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/Rainey_Checkup3/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Rainey takes in a deep breath and sighs pleasantly, the cacophonous music evidently registering to her as nothing more than soft, sweet melodies."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/Rainey_Checkup3/0/g-1/11
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Ahhhh... I've got an edge already man. I'm feelin' high!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/Rainey_Checkup3/0/g-1/19
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Go on now. Leave me be."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/bar_rainey/0/4
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Rainey is for once, not dancing, nor listening to disturbing music. Her face lights up when she sees you, and she immediately surges forward, grabbing your arm."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/bar_rainey/0/12
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "There you are! About time you showed up."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/bar_rainey/0/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What's going on?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/bar_rainey/0/21/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You've been waiting for me?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/bar_rainey/0/22/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Where are you taking me?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/bar_rainey/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Why should I sit around relivin' my glory days by my lonesome?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/bar_rainey/0/g-0/11
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "If nobody's invitin' me to parties anymore I'll make my own!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/bar_rainey/0/g-0/19
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "And YOU'RE comin' with me!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/bar_rainey/0/g-0/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "But where are we going?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/bar_rainey/0/g-0/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can't we just party here?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/bar_rainey/0/g-0/29/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why are you dragging me to the kitchen?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/bar_rainey/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "We're goin' drinking. At Bev's!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/bar_rainey/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Bev's hooch is top shelf!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/bar_rainey/0/g-1/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't really drink..."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/bar_rainey/0/g-1/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That sounds great."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/bar_rainey/0/g-1/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is alcohol really what you need right now?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/bar_rainey/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Oh horsefeathers! I don't care if you drink or not!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/bar_rainey/0/g-1/c-6/15
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Just come with me!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/bar_rainey/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Keen! Let's go!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/bar_rainey/0/g-1/c-8/7
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "What I NEED is to get OSSIFIED! So pipe down and get movin'!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/3/b/1
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Beverly is surprised to see the two of you, but she certainly seems happy enough."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/6
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "There she is, the good time gal herself! The Grande Dame of Giggle Water!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/20
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Well, look what the cat dragged in."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/31/b/1
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Oh, and you too!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/34
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Hey, Bev!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/45
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Hey, yourself. What can I get you?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/53
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Remember that secret stash...?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/61
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Is it time?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/69
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Damn straight!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/77
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "You still remember where it is?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/85
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Like I'd ever forget. Second floor board from the back, third floor board from corner."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/93
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Attagirl! That's my Bevvy."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/101
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "I'll be right back."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/112/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What was that about?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "It's a secret."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/c-0/18
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Here we are. Three Apocalypses for my three favorite customers."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/c-0/26
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "I- I'm... my own favorite customer. BTW."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/c-0/37
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Bottoms up!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "One sec. What's in this?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-0/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Aren't you gonna tell me what this is?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-0/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Does this have alcohol?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Great question! What do you know about Internal Combustion Engines and their propellants?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Not a damn thing!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-1/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "A little I guess..."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-1/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What are you even talking about?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-1/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you serving us jet fuel?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Just a normal drink here. Bottoms up!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Salud!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-2/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Drink up!</i>"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-2/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Take a small, cautious sip.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-2/21/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Toss it over your shoulder.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Ughhh... WHEW! Keep them coming, Bev!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-3/11
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Woohoo! You got it!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-3/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How was that?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-3/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I feel like that can't be good for you..."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-3/21/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Another round?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-3/c-10/7
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Great! I feel better already!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-3/c-11/7
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Don't be such a bluenose!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-3/c-11/15
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "I'm here for a good time not a long time!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-3/c-12/7
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "YES! TOP SHELF GIGGLE JUICE BABY!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Beverly sets another down in front of Rainey, who drains the entire thing in one go."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-4/11
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "You holding up ok? That stuff is... ancient."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-4/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ancient?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-4/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What is it?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-4/21/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Shouldn't it be vinegar by now?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-5/0
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "It's real well-preserved."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-5/8
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "The couple that owned this house in the 70's were real big on making their own wine."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-5/16
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Shirin and Farid Shahidi."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-5/24
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Haven't heard those names in... a long time."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-5/32
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Wasn't everybody drinkin' this stuff that night you... uh..."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-5/40
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "There is a long silence as Beverly's words settle in. Rainey's face crumples into a sob."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-5/45
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Oh no. R-Rainey, I..."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-5/53
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "WAHHHH!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-5/64
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Rainey slams her arms down onto the bar, and her face follows shortly after. It does little to muffle her anguished wails."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-5/72/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Damn Beverly, what did you do?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-5/72/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What's the problem?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-5/72/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Don't cry, Rainey..."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-5/72/c-16/7
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Me!? I didn't... I mean, I was... I was just... asking..."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-5/72/c-17/7
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Well... you know, ever since that night..."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-5/72/c-18/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Your comforting words have no impact on the distraught record player."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-7/0
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "It's no secret our sweet Rainey hasn't really been herself for a good long time now."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-7/8
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "She puts on a brave face but it's hard to know if people are pulling away from you or acting like you're some kinda weirdo."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-7/16
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "One minute everybody wants you at all their parties and the next people are actin' like they don't know you... that hurts."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-7/24
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Rainey finally quiets, though she doesn't lift her head."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-7/29
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Everybody thinks I don't know what they say about me... or I don't see how they look at me."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-7/37
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Just 'cause I act like everything's copacetic they think they can say whatever they want."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-7/45
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Rainey lifts her head to look at you, her pretty face streaked with tears."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-7/50
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "You're the only one who's been hangin' out with me lately."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-7/58
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "You know I got a few screws loose but you're still here..."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-7/66
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "You really don't mind it?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-7/74/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Who among us has all their screws anyway?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-7/75/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You didn't give me much choice, did you?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-7/76/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "When you say screws loose... are you being literal?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-7/c-19/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Rainey laughs, a sincere smile amidst the sadness."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-7/c-20/7
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Well, I... I guess not."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-7/c-21/7
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Well... yeah?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-8/0
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "People think I don't know what's wrong with me, but I do."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-8/8
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "I can feel those damn screws rattling every time I dance."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-8/16
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "It just reminds me of what happened."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-8/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So why haven't you fixed it?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-8/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "If you know what's wrong, then why..."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-8/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You could have gotten help years ago."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-9/0
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Because I'm scared!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-9/8
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Would you be ok lettin' someone mess around with your mind?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-9/16
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Fundamentally changing who you are?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-9/24
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Maybe I'm weird now, but I'm still me."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-9/32
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "And if I tighten those screws back up, well, who am I then?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-9/40
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "And is everybody gonna start coming back around pretending they didn't abandon me when I wasn't good?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-9/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe they will... but you'll know the truth."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-9/49/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You can't hold yourself back on other people's account."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-9/50/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You deserve to be your best self Rainey... no matter what happens."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-10/0
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "I guess so."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-10/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Rainey sighs, examining her own distorted reflection in Beverly's cocktail shaker."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-10/13
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "You do deserve better, Rainey. And besides..."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-10/21
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Not everybody's left your side. I've been here and I'll be here."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-10/29
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Maybe you make some new friendships, maybe you get to know yourself all over again."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_barexcursion/0/g-10/37
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "But you don't have to be alone anymore. You deserve to be okay."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/Tony_Interruptus/0/6
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Someone comes sliding onto a stool next to the two of you, shooting you and Rainey a cheeky wink and a few finger guns as he does so."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/Tony_Interruptus/0/17
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Ayyy! Look who it is!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/Tony_Interruptus/0/28
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Tony!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/Tony_Interruptus/0/36
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Dollface!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/Tony_Interruptus/0/44
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "What're you doin' here?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/Tony_Interruptus/0/52
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Oh, you know... just tryin' to mend my broken heart."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/Tony_Interruptus/0/60
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "You need help with that? Cause I got this new staple gun... works like a dream."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/Tony_Interruptus/0/68
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "No, no, no. It's... it's just a figure of speech."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/Tony_Interruptus/0/79
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Damn... I really like that staple gun."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/Tony_Interruptus/0/87
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "I actually could use your help, though... you are <i>just</i> in time."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/Tony_Interruptus/0/95
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Ol' Tony's always just in time! What'd you need, cutie?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/Tony_Interruptus/0/103
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "...do you have a screwdriver?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/Tony_Interruptus/0/111
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Oh yeah, I got a couple 'a those. You want that flat lookin' one or the pointy star-shaped one?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/Tony_Interruptus/0/119
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "The Philips head, please."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/Tony_Interruptus/0/127
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Who's Phillip."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/Tony_Interruptus/0/135
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "What's wrong wit his head?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/Tony_Interruptus/0/143
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Um."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/Tony_Interruptus/0/154
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "The pointy star-shaped one."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/Tony_Interruptus/0/162
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Duh, yeah. I was just testin' you, but hey, you passed!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/Tony_Interruptus/0/173
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "<i>I</i> knew that. And you don't tell nobody no different!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/Tony_Interruptus/0/181
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "I'll drop those off for ya later."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/Tony_Interruptus/0/189
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Thanks, Tony!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/Tony_Interruptus/0/197
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Anythin' for you, dollface."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/Tony_Interruptus/0/205
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "And Bevvy, baby... beer me, would ya?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/Tony_Interruptus/0/213
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "You got it boss."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/Tony_Interruptus/0/221
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "I'll see you two later then... and I'll bring that Felipe... uh, Feh... that head from the Philip guy."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/Tony_Interruptus/0/229
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Phillips head... remember, the pointy star-shaped one."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/Tony_Interruptus/0/237
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Yeah yeah, pointy-star shape, I knew that."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/Tony_Interruptus/0/251
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "God, I can't believe I just did that."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/Tony_Interruptus/0/259
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "I'm proud of you."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/Tony_Interruptus/0/267/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm proud too."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/Tony_Interruptus/0/268/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's about time."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/Tony_Interruptus/0/269/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you scared?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/Tony_Interruptus/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "...means a lot to hear that."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/Tony_Interruptus/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Yeah... yeah."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/Tony_Interruptus/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Well, of course! This is..."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/Tony_Interruptus/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "I think... I should probably be alone for a little while."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/Tony_Interruptus/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "One more for the road, Bev?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/Tony_Interruptus/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "You got it."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/Tony_Interruptus/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Thanks... both of you."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_minigame_screwing/0/6
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Rainey is pacing when you find her, wearing a small circle into the carpet beneath her feet. She's clearly been at this a while."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_minigame_screwing/0/14
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "You're here!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_minigame_screwing/0/22/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I am..."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_minigame_screwing/0/23/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ready to get screwed?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_minigame_screwing/0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's get this over with."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_minigame_screwing/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Hooo. Lord."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_minigame_screwing/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Is anybody ever really ready?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_minigame_screwing/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Yeah..."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_minigame_screwing/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "All right, no point putting it off anymore."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_minigame_screwing/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "I... I need you to screw me."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_minigame_screwing/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Specifically I need you to take this screwdriver and tighten my screws."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_minigame_screwing/0/g-0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm pretty handy with a screwdriver."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_minigame_screwing/0/g-0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It can't be that hard."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_minigame_screwing/0/g-0/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's get goin'."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_minigame_screwing/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Hold on hold on. There's uh... one more thing."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_minigame_screwing/0/g-1/11
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "...I gotta take my top off."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_minigame_screwing/0/g-1/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We can just turn the lights off then."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_minigame_screwing/0/g-1/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's gooooo..."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_minigame_screwing/0/g-1/21/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Do you want me to close my eyes?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_minigame_screwing/0/g-1/22/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That sounds easy enough. Righty tighty..."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_minigame_screwing/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "But you gotta see what you're doin'..."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_minigame_screwing/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Oh lay off, would ya!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_minigame_screwing/0/g-1/c-7/18
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Don't act like you ain't never seen a pair of tits before!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_minigame_screwing/0/g-1/c-7/26/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Good point..."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_minigame_screwing/0/g-1/c-7/26/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So what if I haven't!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_minigame_screwing/0/g-1/c-8/7
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "I don't need you scratchin' me up tryin' to find the screws."
