msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_love_return/0/c-0/23/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm ready to Realize you, Rainey!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_love_return/0/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "That's the spirit!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_love_return/0/c-0/23/c-0/18 rainey_record/rainey_friend_return/0/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Hit it, me!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_love_return/0/c-0/23/c-0/26 rainey_record/rainey_friend_return/0/c-0/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Rainey takes you by the hand, and the two of you cut an absolutely furious rug together."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_love_return/0/c-0/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Oooh, you're speakin' my language now!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_love_return/0/c-0/23/c-1/18
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Let's get outta here..."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_love_return/0/c-0/23/c-1/26
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You and Rainey beat it, losing yourselves in your own little world. The necking is top-tier, the absolute cat's pajamas."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_friend_return/0/0
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Well if it ain't my old so-and-so."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_friend_return/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hey, Rainey! You feeling okay? Need anything tuned up?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_friend_return/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm ready to Realize you, Rainey."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_friend_return/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "I got no kick. I don't need anything now, but I'll holler if I do."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_friend_return/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Let's cut a rug, baby!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_friend_return/0/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "After you!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_hate_return/0/0
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Well well well."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_hate_return/0/8
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "If it ain't the worst human being I ever met."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_hate_return/0/19
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Can't believe nobody's plugged ya yet."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_hate_return/0/27
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Whatever you have to say, save it!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_hate_return/0/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Then I won't say anything at all."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_hate_return/0/36/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm sorry Rainey, I was beyond out of line. (USE EMPATHY CANDY)"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_hate_return/0/c-1/21
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "You were. You really, really were."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_hate_return/0/c-1/29
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "But I'm real short on friends at the moment."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_hate_return/0/c-1/37
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "You hurt me bad... but if I'm bein' honest I missed ya."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_hate_return/0/c-1/48
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "We can't be any more than friends... but gee, I'd really love to be friends again."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_hate_return/0/c-1/56
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Come on back and see me sometime, alright?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_realize_join/0/0
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Huh!? Realization!? Are you pullin' my leg?!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_realize_join/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not at all, I'm serious and I'm ready."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_realize_join/0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, sorry. I'm not ready yet."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_realize_join/0/c-1/10
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Aww, applesauce! Don't do that to me!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_realize_return/0/0
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "You done jokin' around? You ready to Realize me?"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_realize_return/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, I'm ready now."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_realize_return/0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sorry, not yet."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_realize_return/0/c-1/10
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Horsefeathers! Stop jerkin' me around!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_realize_begin/6/b/1
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Rainey will be our first Realized dateable - she's gonna be popular once more!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_realize_begin/9
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Platter up!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_realize_begin/20
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The spectral energy flows through your dateviators, and what was once merely a record player, becomes...."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_realized/0/3
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Oh my god..."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_realized/0/14
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "What is this feeling? I feel like I could dance all night long..."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_realized/0/22
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Look at these gams and look at this caboose!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_realized/0/30
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "I'm a gen-u-ine human being!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_realized/0/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You really are! It suits you."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_realized/0/42/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're so much more than that to me, Rainey..."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_realized/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "I can't believe you did this for me... wasn't enough for you to fix my screws."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_realized/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "You gave me my life back... and then you gave me a new life altogether!"
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_realized/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "I'm never gonna forget this."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_realized/0/c-0/34
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "You're gonna see my name up in lights out there... and I want you to know it's all 'cause of you."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_realized/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Oh yeah? Why don't we get outta here..."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_realized/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "And you can tell me just what I am to you... in private."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_love_divert/3
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Rainey was a good time as a record player, but as a human woman she's a real bearcat, a firecracker in and out of the bedroom."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_love_divert/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "But as fiery as she may be, there's a real sweetness and care in her touch."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_love_divert/13
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "This isn't just frenzied rutting—you find yourself truly dizzy with this dame, your sweet lovemaking leaving a lasting impression on you long after she's left your house."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_love_join/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Rainey sets her sights on musical theater, determined to see her name up in lights... but fame and accolades are slow to come, and for a moment, Rainey finds herself deeply discouraged."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_love_join/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "But Rainey has spent many years dancing to the beat of her own drum, and the lack of recognition for her efforts only galvanizes her further."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_love_join/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "In a serendipitous turn of events, Rainey is cast in a 1920's-style jazz musical homage to the powdery old-time gangster Talc Capone."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_love_join/24
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "With \"Talc!\" - her star begins to rise. Reviews rave that Rainey is the very spirit of the Roaring 20's, an actress so talented she transports the viewer back in time."
msgstr ""

#: rainey_record/rainey_love_join/32
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Rainey sends you her playbill and a photo of her name in lights, just as she'd hoped—when you're ready to leave the house, she's reserved tickets for you."
msgstr ""
